Package: jupyter.htmlwidgets
Title: Display and Interact with HTML Widgets in Jupyter
Version: 0.0.0.9002
Authors@R: 
    c(
        person("Romain", "François", email = "first.last@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre")), 
        person("QuantStack", role = c("cph"))
    )
Description: Display interactive HTML widgets in Jupyter notebooks
    using the xeus-r kernel. Provides support for rendering widgets
    created with the htmlwidgets package and communicating between
    R and JavaScript through Jupyter comms, including Shiny-compatible
    inputs and custom messages without requiring a Shiny server.
URL: https://github.com/romainfrancois/xeus-r-htmlwidget
BugReports: https://github.com/romainfrancois/xeus-r-htmlwidget/issues
